      "init": {
        "label": "Cubes: nested tables",
        "body": "A **Cube** is a Frame whose cells hold ANY value: a scalar, list, nested **Frame**, or another **Cube**. It is the recursive container that closes the socket lattice. One **Orders** fact table + two dimensions drive every demo; drill any chip for the breadcrumb.",
